      "table": null,
      "text": "•Developer Platform: delivers a fully managed AI development platform, through Vertex AI, for accessing, tuning, augmenting, and deploying custom models and agents, helping customers build applications with more than 200 foundation models, including our Gemini family, third-party, and open models.",
